    (at 328.995 162.5 180)
    (descr "hanxia HX JN2.54-2x5P TP H8.9, SMD 2x5 2.54mm box header, LCSC C41376028. From the hanxia drawing (datasheets/hanxia-HX-JN2.54-2x5P-TP-H8.9.pdf): pads per its RECOMMEND P.C.B LAYOUT, 1.02 x 4.65 on 2.54 pitch, 11.50 overall; body 20.30 x 8.90, seated height 9.60, leg tips 10.20 across; key slot 4.50 wide in one long wall. Pin 1 is at the triangle end on the key-side row (the triangle is moulded on the key wall).")
